<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>What e’er thou lovest, man,</l><l>That too become thou must;</l><l>God, if thou lovest God,</l><l>Dust, if thou lovest dust.</l><l>Go out, God will come in;</l><l>Die thou and let Him live;</l><l>Be not and He will be;</l><l>Wait and He’ll all things give.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>To bring thee to thy God,</l><l>Love takes the shortest route;</l><l>The way which knowledge leads,</l><l>Is but a roundabout.</l><l>Drive out from thee the world,</l><l>And then thy heart shall be</l><l>Filled with the love of God,</l><l>And holy like as He.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
